Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:25.48,Hook,,0,0,0,,MI ABUELA NOS VA A\NENTERRAR A TODOS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Estoy esperando a que se\Nhaga de noche.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Duerman, vergas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Hoy no quería prender\Nporque, bueno, el cumple\Nde
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:09.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}mi abuela, viste, y quería\Npasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:10.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cuántos cumple, boludo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:13.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No se le pregunta, no se\Nle pregunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:16.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Una banda.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Amigo, es una banda,\N¿viste?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Un montón, mal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Nos va a enterrar a todos,\Nboludo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Está re sana encima, está\Nre lúcida.
